# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Create a small wrapper that:
#   - compiles
#   - backs up current Wazuh Sigma XML
#   - installs generated XML
#   - validates Wazuh
#   - rolls back on failure
#   - restarts Wazuh only when the generated rule set actually changed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

